Package: ruview-sensing
Version: @VERSION@-1
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: RuView Team <maintainers@ruview.local>
Homepage: https://github.com/ruvnet/RuView
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.31), systemd | systemd-sysv, ca-certificates
Recommends: mosquitto, mosquitto-clients
Suggests: librknnrt | rknpu2-runtime, build-essential, curl, pkg-config, tcpdump
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Description: RuView WiFi-CSI sensing server for Orange Pi
 RuView turns commodity WiFi Channel State Information (CSI) into
 occupancy, motion, and vital-sign estimates. This package provides the
 sensing-server daemon plus the observatory web UI for the Orange Pi
 5 Pro (RK3588) reference platform.
 .
 The package is self-contained for POC use: it ships the prebuilt
 binary AND the v2 Rust workspace source under /usr/src/ruview/, so
 the binary can be rebuilt on-device with /usr/lib/ruview/rebuild.sh
 when a Rust toolchain is installed.
 .
 REST API at :3022, WebSocket at :3023, UI at http://<host>:3022/ui/.
